      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3 categories of AI agents\n\n1. Software based agent: chatbot that provides customer service on retail website.\n2. Physical agent: A domestic robot that cleans your home and responds to voice commands.\n3. Hybrid and adaptive agents (real-world integration): AI-drive traffic system that analyzes live camera feeds and adjusts signal timing based on congestion",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3 categories of AI agents\n\n1. Software based agent: chatbot that provides customer service on retail website.\n2. Physical agent: A domestic robot that cleans your home and responds to voice commands.\n3. Hybrid and adaptive agents (real-world integration): AI-drive traffic system that analyzes live camera feeds and adjusts signal timing based on congestion",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
