    {
      "id": "JzXjeaMmVCYeFgx304vvM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 736.05078125,
      "y": 573.375,
      "width": 946.1993408203125,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 799015206,
      "version": 717,
      "versionNonce": 1805573114,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777139973712,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rule based agents: Fixed logic, limited flexibility\n- if the user says \"I forgot my password\", then show a password reset form\n- if the temperature exceeds 30*C, turn on the fan\n\nLearning based agents: Trial and feedback\n- AlhpaGo learned to defeat world class Go players by playing millions of games agains itself.\n- Robot arms trained with RL can learn to pick up objects without needing precise location data.\n\nLLM powered agents: Generalization through language\n- Summarize this research paper and email the key points to my team.\nzero shot generalization (handling novel tasks without needing retraining)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rule based agents: Fixed logic, limited flexibility\n- if the user says \"I forgot my password\", then show a password reset form\n- if the temperature exceeds 30*C, turn on the fan\n\nLearning based agents: Trial and feedback\n- AlhpaGo learned to defeat world class Go players by playing millions of games agains itself.\n- Robot arms trained with RL can learn to pick up objects without needing precise location data.\n\nLLM powered agents: Generalization through language\n- Summarize this research paper and email the key points to my team.\nzero shot generalization (handling novel tasks without needing retraining)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XDizVjahfL9GhjG_UnrMu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 730.75390625,
      "y": 894.671875,
      "width": 909.8792724609375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2110088166,
      "version": 324,
      "versionNonce": 264001210,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777139977793,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AI Agents: autonomous systems that perceive, reason and act to achieve goals.\nAI Models: passive and task-specific, operate over time, maintain context and take initiative.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AI Agents: autonomous systems that perceive, reason and act to achieve goals.\nAI Models: passive and task-specific, operate over time, maintain context and take initiative.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1bp6p-HAO9OxFJJlUmvEn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 319.8515625,
      "y": 1031.23046875,
      "width": 1626.7388916015625,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1148208102,
      "version": 730,
      "versionNonce": 499168550,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777147550831,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Agent Memory:\n\n1. Short term memory: holds recent context, typically within a single session or interaction. Implemented using in-session context window or lightweight memory buffers\n\n2. Long term memory: Persiste across sessions. Stores important information that the agent might need to refer back to in the future\n    - User preferences or settings\n    - Notes about past decisions or outcomes\n    - Historical interactions or completed tasks\n\n3. External or Knowledge memory: Agent's ability to look up relevant information from outside sources (documents, knowledge bases or APIs)\n    - Search a knowledge base\n    - Retrieve matching documents\n    - Pull facts from external systems",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Agent Memory:\n\n1. Short term memory: holds recent context, typically within a single session or interaction. Implemented using in-session context window or lightweight memory buffers\n\n2. Long term memory: Persiste across sessions. Stores important information that the agent might need to refer back to in the future\n    - User preferences or settings\n    - Notes about past decisions or outcomes\n    - Historical interactions or completed tasks\n\n3. External or Knowledge memory: Agent's ability to look up relevant information from outside sources (documents, knowledge bases or APIs)\n    - Search a knowledge base\n    - Retrieve matching documents\n    - Pull facts from external systems",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
