    {
      "id": "z5LtMeelmXDxuSP36kRUt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1965.5071149553569,
      "y": 4714.055106026784,
      "width": 1566.8587646484375,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 823430330,
      "version": 813,
      "versionNonce": 931683642,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777162656893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Multi layered guardrails\n    - input filtering: detect and block malicious prompts (prompt injections)\n    - PII redaction: automatically identify and mask sensitive personal information\n    - Tool use safeguards: Restrict unauthorized or risky actions by tools (allowlisting, argument validation, rate limits)\n    - Output moderation: Filter harmful or inappropriate generated content.\n\n- Authentication and authorizaton: Strong access controls to ensure only authorized users or systems can interact with the agent\n\n- Secure deployment practices\n\n- Differential Privacy: differential privacy techniqures during model traning or inference to protect individual data points from being inferred from agent outputs.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Multi layered guardrails\n    - input filtering: detect and block malicious prompts (prompt injections)\n    - PII redaction: automatically identify and mask sensitive personal information\n    - Tool use safeguards: Restrict unauthorized or risky actions by tools (allowlisting, argument validation, rate limits)\n    - Output moderation: Filter harmful or inappropriate generated content.\n\n- Authentication and authorizaton: Strong access controls to ensure only authorized users or systems can interact with the agent\n\n- Secure deployment practices\n\n- Differential Privacy: differential privacy techniqures during model traning or inference to protect individual data points from being inferred from agent outputs.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wRxLhDewPVsC-LAFXOJcp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6186.810825892857,
      "y": 115.67131696428442,
      "width": 985.359375,
      "height": 1125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1735633338,
      "version": 104,
      "versionNonce": 64804710,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777164257398,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Strategy\n\n\n- Performance and latency:\n\n    Are response times within acceptable limits for critical user journeys?\n    Has the system been tested under peak load conditions?\n    Are the cost implications of LLM inference and tool usage understood and managed?\n\n- Reliability and accuracy:\n\n    Are hallucination rates minimized, especially for high-stakes outputs?\n    Are key decisions validated (e.g., via RAG, output guardrails, ensembling)?\n    Are error handling and retry mechanisms in place for tool failures?\n    Can the system gracefully degrade if a non-critical component fails?\n    \n- Memory management:\n\n    Is memory consistency maintained across turns and agents?\n    Are policies for sensitive data retention/expiration implemented?\n    Is the memory system scalable for long-term use?\n    \n- Security and privacy:\n\n    Are all inputs/outputs filtered for safety, PII, and malicious content?\n    Are tool access policies strictly enforced?\n    Are authentication and authorization mechanisms robust?\n    \n- Human oversight and intervention:\n\n    Are clear human-in-the-loop (HITL) points defined for high-risk actions?\n    Are intervention interfaces intuitive, and do they provide sufficient context for human reviewers?\n    Are audit trails and logging comprehensive for accountability and post-mortem analysis?\n    \n- Observability and monitoring:\n\n    Are continuous monitoring and alerting systems in place for key performance and safety metrics?\n    Can the system’s internal reasoning and tool usage be easily traced and debugged?\n\n    \n- Scalability and maintainability:\n    \n    Is the architecture modular and extensible for future updates and scaling?    \n    Are deployment strategies optimized for efficiency and resilience?\n    Is the documentation clear for ongoing maintenance and development?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Strategy\n\n\n- Performance and latency:\n\n    Are response times within acceptable limits for critical user journeys?\n    Has the system been tested under peak load conditions?\n    Are the cost implications of LLM inference and tool usage understood and managed?\n\n- Reliability and accuracy:\n\n    Are hallucination rates minimized, especially for high-stakes outputs?\n    Are key decisions validated (e.g., via RAG, output guardrails, ensembling)?\n    Are error handling and retry mechanisms in place for tool failures?\n    Can the system gracefully degrade if a non-critical component fails?\n    \n- Memory management:\n\n    Is memory consistency maintained across turns and agents?\n    Are policies for sensitive data retention/expiration implemented?\n    Is the memory system scalable for long-term use?\n    \n- Security and privacy:\n\n    Are all inputs/outputs filtered for safety, PII, and malicious content?\n    Are tool access policies strictly enforced?\n    Are authentication and authorization mechanisms robust?\n    \n- Human oversight and intervention:\n\n    Are clear human-in-the-loop (HITL) points defined for high-risk actions?\n    Are intervention interfaces intuitive, and do they provide sufficient context for human reviewers?\n    Are audit trails and logging comprehensive for accountability and post-mortem analysis?\n    \n- Observability and monitoring:\n\n    Are continuous monitoring and alerting systems in place for key performance and safety metrics?\n    Can the system’s internal reasoning and tool usage be easily traced and debugged?\n\n    \n- Scalability and maintainability:\n    \n    Is the architecture modular and extensible for future updates and scaling?    \n    Are deployment strategies optimized for efficiency and resilience?\n    Is the documentation clear for ongoing maintenance and development?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
